{"id":"n83962-1-7","stage":2,"title":"하숙 · 寄宿","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83962-1-7-1","ko":"그럼 지금 자취하세요?","zh":"那您现在自己租房做饭吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자취하세요?","meaning":"自炊，自己做饭","explanation":"자취하다：自炊，自己做饭；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"자취하다","audio":"/audio/a0b1b6527275be9a20b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73209","senseId":"1","lemma":"자취하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"a0b1b6527275be9a","term":"자취하다","zh":"自炊，自己做饭","audio":"/audio/a0b1b6527275be9a20b9.mp3","entryId":"73209","definition":"不和家人生活在一起，自己做饭吃，独自生活。","pronunciation":["자취하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c069bd42cb0924cc9afa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83962-1-7-2","ko":"아니요. 학교 근처에서 하숙을 하고 있어요.","zh":"不是，我在学校附近寄宿，房东提供食宿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"근처에서","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하숙을","meaning":"寄宿，下宿，借宿","explanation":"하숙：寄宿，下宿，借宿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하숙","audio":"/audio/ca97cdfab223556b84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83962","senseId":"1","lemma":"하숙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"进行某事（하숙을 하다：寄宿）","explanation":"하다：进行某事（하숙을 하다：寄宿）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"ca97cdfab223556b","term":"하숙","zh":"寄宿，下宿，借宿","audio":"/audio/ca97cdfab223556b84be.mp3","entryId":"83962","definition":"交房租和伙食费而在别人家里吃住；或指那样的人家。","pronunciation":["하ː숙"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"进行某事（하숙을 하다：寄宿）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某事（하숙을 하다：寄宿）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e67882ce296aa432a57d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.551,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83962","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2763,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不是，我在学校附近寄宿，房东提供食宿。","哎呀，天已经黑了啊。","那您现在自己租房做饭吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不是，我在学校附近寄宿，房东提供食宿。","那您现在自己租房做饭吗？","哎呀，天已经黑了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
